106	// key. This is what makes the relation verbs (neighbors/impact, which index the
107	// whole repository) warm on their second call instead of re-indexing from
108	// scratch — and it never hides a dirty edit, because a dirty indexable file
109	// fails the check and bypasses the cache exactly as before.
